          "description": "\"You hear music coming from the alleyway and you go to investigate. You see the cute girl you saw some years ago listening to music. She asks if you want to sing with her and you agree...\"This mod contains Flashing Lights! Player discretion is advised.This is a reimagination of the Original QT mod by Hazard24 and CountNightShade.Despite featuring the characters you know and love, this mod is not associated with the Original QT Mod / Brutality Labs lore.We're going to take a different approach in the storytelling, revealing our own story through little glimpses here and there.Hopefully you'll enjoy what we have in store!This mod includes an exclusive Mobile Version, fully compatible with Friday Night Funkin' for mobile devices. Mechanics and performance have been specially adapted for a smooth experience!BOO!Your favorite Robot Girl is back for a Limited Time only, and with a brand new outfit for this Spooky Occasion!Make sure you don't miss your chance to bring this Halloween-themed QT Plushie home!Get yours here!",
