          "id": 653229,
          "title": "Friday Night Funkin': Remnants",
          "description": "What is Funkin' Remnants? It started out as a gimmick account on Twitter that's dedicated to archiving old content for Friday Night Funkin'!Now we've developed a fully fledged remix mod for the game which features many unused elements that have been covered on Funkin' Remnants Socials before.It also has a pretty nice wireframe style that tries to recapture the simpler vibes of other popular remix mods from back in the day. Neat ain't it?Sing against your wireframe self in a space between dimensions and then play as them through Character Select to experience about 35 bangin' remixed tracks! There's lots to see...THIS MOD WORKS FOR V-SLICE 0.8.6! IF THE MOD STOPS WORKING ON ANY LATER RELEASES WE'LL BE SURE TO UPDATE THE MODPACK AGAIN!Developed by The Funkin' Remnants Crew (2026)",
